      "doctor_question": "Hello, I’m Dr. ____. What brings you in today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S014",
      "patient_response": "I’m here because I feel like I’m always running hot, you know? Like I can’t shut the motor off. And lately, that’s been getting me in trouble at the firehouse. Which is crazy because I love the guys there. We had this chili cook-off last weekend, actually, and I swear Henderson put ghost peppers in his batch just to mess with me. I was sweating through my shirt for an hour. But yeah, anyway, the captain pulled me aside yesterday and said I need to get a handle on things because I'm just constantly pacing around the rigs when we're supposed to be on downtime. I just... I can't just sit in the recliner and watch TV with the rest of them. My legs start twitching if I sit for more than five minutes.",
